    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Pitted citrus rind is carried in geometry and normal map and stays convincing from every angle, with a correctly modelled stem scar on top and blossom nub underneath rather than a mirrored sphere. Green-to-yellow ripeness variation is photographic. 8.1k tris and only 2.8 MB.",
